Conflict is okay! And all of us want to get better. I just think that something like this is subjective. If you liked the story, then it was a good one. If you didn't, then you think of how you would have done it to make it better. When I posted before, I was saying that it doesn't get us anywhere by the "I liked it" and "I didn't" posts. Both are right and there is no point in trying to convert one side to the other, because it won't happen. <br />

</p>
